        "TileImage": "$($repository df617e32-609c-4aea-bf56-b2a98e4c6c4c).Image",
        "Description": "The target is Stephane Marichal. A spanish international arms dealer.\r\rThe family have been involved in arms dealing since the spanish civil war and have expanded their wealth and influence throughout the 20th century.\r\rOur client wants him dead to stop the expansion of a rival into their sphere of influence in south africa. Friends of the client will be attending the auction, make the hit as clean as possible, only the target dies.\r\rGood luck.",
